window.products.push({"id":241005,"name":"Leggett & Platt Olympia Counter Stool with Black Matte Finished Metal Frame, Footrest and Black Cherry Colored Wood, 26-Inch Seat Height","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gmPqDlU6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Olympia uses simplicity as the key to create a comfortable and casual environment, while matching the decor of any office, dining or entertainment area. A comfortable and portable stool has always had a place in the home (or apartment) for kids doing homework at the counter, paired with bistro tables for casual eating, or used as extra seating in entertaining areas. With this in mind, the Olympia has been designed to provide a relaxing and inviting seat option for many years to come. Constructed of solid wood and carbon steel for strength and stability, this stool is paired with a hand-applied, 10-step Black Cherry wood finish and Black Matte frame to create a warm and inviting seating option. This piece features long, straight lines, giving it a clean and polished look. The square tube frame, wooden seat, seatback, and (4) legs complete the look of this transitional styled piece. A footrest is provided to rest your heels and plays a very critical role in the comfort experienced by most adults. This unit includes all stool pieces, instruction sheet, and hardware bag with everything needed for easy assembly. The Leggett & Platt Olympia Stool comes with a 1-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. Leggett & Platt Inc. is an industry leader in the production of adjustable bases, fashionable beds, bedding support, and top of bed textiles. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Leggett & Platt stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes, innovative designs, and technology to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value. Leggett & Platt Consumer Products: Value Without Compromise","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gmPqDlU6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B00ORW3Q5I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ORW3Q5I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ORW3Q5I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
