window.products.push({"id":241062,"name":"Dependable Industries Inc. Essentials Criss Cross Metal Napkin Holder Self Standing Table Top Modern Design (Chrome- Round)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pdor+E5SL._AC_SL1246_.jpg","description":"Introducing the latest addition to our collection of kitchen and dining accessories - the metal napkin holder with raised balls on the bottom. This innovative and stylish napkin holder is designed to keep your napkins clean and dry while adding a touch of elegance to your table setting. The unique design of this napkin holder features a crisscross pattern that will complement any home decor, whether modern, traditional, or rustic. The raised balls on the bottom not only provide a stylish touch but also serve a practical purpose. By keeping the napkin holder off the table, the napkins remain dry and free from any spills or stains. The metal construction of this napkin holder ensures its durability, making it suitable for use in both residential and commercial kitchens. Whether you are hosting a dinner party, running a restaurant, or managing a hotel, this napkin holder will meet your needs. With its generous capacity, this napkin holder can hold a considerable amount of napkins, ensuring that you won't run out during a meal. The upright design of the napkin holder also makes it easy to grab a napkin with just one hand, making it perfect for busy kitchens and dining rooms. In addition to its practicality and functionality, this napkin holder is also easy to clean and maintain. Simply wipe it down with a damp cloth, and it will look as good as new. In conclusion, the metal napkin holder with raised balls on the bottom is a versatile and stylish addition to any home or commercial kitchen. With its crisscross design, durable construction, and practical features, it is sure to impress and meet all your napkin holding needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pdor+E5SL._AC_SL1246_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dependable Industries inc. Essentials","source_asin":"B0BZZRS156","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241062","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZZRS156","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZZRS156","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
