window.products.push({"id":241098,"name":"Pansyling Large Acrylic 3-Slot Wall Mounted Smart Phone Charging Holder Station Clear Hanging TV Remote Control Holder Media Organizer Wall Pocket Cad","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sR-EVhtPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏠[3-Slot Fashion Shape]: A PROTECTIVE FILM should be removed before use, which can avoid scratches & fade! Keep Everything In Order -- Although Specially For The Smart Phone Charging And Remote Controls, Yet This Storage Holder Box Is Also For Pens, Keys, Makeups, Cards, Leaflets, Etc. 3 Organizing Slots Can Help You Sort The Tools And Arrange Them Orderly! Tidy The Surroundings Of The House To Keep a Good Mood! 🏠[Charging Hole Design]: Charge Your Phone Beside The Sockets -- Compared With The Ones Without The Charging Holes Which Requires Put The Phone Upside Down When Charging, Our Holder Enables The Charging Phone To Stand Normally So As To Protect The Phone And Charging Wire From Bending! Ideal For Phone Charging Around The Bedside! 🏠[Protective Film]: Get The Perfect Product Before Arrival -- Many Others Without The Protective Film Can Easy Get Scratches In Transport! But Don`t Worry About It On Our Product! We Package It With a Piece Of Smooth Covering Film, Which Can Protect The Clear Storage Holder Box From Scratching. We Are Aiming At Your Greatest Satisfaction! 🏠[ No Drilling Available & 3mm In Thickness]: Extra Solid Shell For Durability -- Two Ways of installing optional: double faced adhesive pads and screws with nuts! No drilling on your wall with the adhesive pads, enough for daily use. But more sturdy if you choose the screws way! Enhanced Thick Body Shell Of 3mm! More Solid And Powerful For Stable Use With Great Impact-Resistance! High quality for Durable Lifespan to save your fees! 🏠[All-Purpose Organizer]: Fit For Almost Everywhere In The House -- Perfect For TV Or Air Conditioner Remote Controls Storage And Smart Phone Charging In Living Room And Bedroom, But It Can Also Allow Your Phone To Play Music In Bathroom During Shower For Its Steam/ Water Proof. Besides, This Holder Stand Can Be Applied In Bedroom, Kitchen, Office, Workshop, Etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sR-EVhtPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pansyling","source_asin":"B09783CLYL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09783CLYL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09783CLYL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":241099,"name":"TASVAC Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 28Kpa Powerful Stick Vacuum Cleaner with LED Display, 6 in 1 Lightweight Cordless Vacuum Max 50 Mins Runtime, Handheld","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61N6PYOz7UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【28000Pa Exceptional Suction Power】: With a 260W upgraded brushless digital motor, TASVAC S8 cordless vacuum cleaner generates an impressive 28Kpa suction force on max mode. With three speed power suction that can be switched freely, it easily picks up pet hair, debris and large particles from carpets, hardwood floors, area rugs and marble floors, while also providing less disturbance (<63dB) to your family and pets. 【Long-Lasting Detachable Battery】: This stick vacuum cleaner cordless provides up to 50 minutes of runtime on standard mode and 20 minutes on max mode, thanks to its 2400mAh 8-cell battery. The battery is detachable and can be separately charged, and uses the latest smart chips that provide over-voltage, overheat, and short circuit protection, ensuring high power and low power loss. It is perfect for large jobs and full house cleaning. 【User-Friendly Design & LED Display】: TASVAC vacuum cleaner for carpet and floor features a maneuverable motorized floor head with 5 LED lights that can rotate sideways and up and down, allowing you to easily clean dust from every corner, including under the sofa. The LED display shows the indicator, roller brush clog alert, filter clog alert, power mode indicator, and power mode switch. Vacuum problems can be handled more quickly, making cleaning more efficient. 【Advanced Filtration System】: This hardwood floor vacuum features a 5-stage filtration system that captures 99.99% of microscopic dust particles as small as 0.1 microns, preventing secondary air pollution. The advanced HEPA filters, mesh filters, stainless steel filters, and cyclones work together to provide ultimate purified air for your family. Plus, the washable and recyclable HEPA filter comes with an extra one as a gift. 𝐍𝐎𝐓𝐄: Cleaning the filter regularly will keep the handheld vacuum from weak suction and clogging. 【Flexible Featherweight Design & Easy to Use】: The flexible 180° lateral rotation and 90° up and down rotation allow you to clean your home in all directions. The 1L large dustbin can be emptied with one button. Weighing only 3.75lbs, this rechargeable vacuum is easy to handle and perfect for one-hand cleaning. 【TASVAC Package】: S8 cordless vacuum cleaner comes with a normal and a mini motorized brush head, a 2-in-1 brush, and a long crevice, which can be easily assembled into 6 combinations for versatile cleaning. Suitable for sofas, cars, keyboards, and gaps. Comes with one year of reliable 12-hour response service, accessories replacement, and zero-risk purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61N6PYOz7UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TASVAC","source_asin":"B0C2VJW2J5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2VJW2J5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2VJW2J5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
