window.products.push({"id":241147,"name":"YRYM HT Parchment Paper Sheets - 200pcs No-Curl, No Tear, No Burn Baking Paper 9 x 13 Inch, Oven Safe and Heat Resistant Precut Parchment Paper for Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c9hA8O88L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PRECUT & SMART PACKAGE】 Forget annoying parchment paper sheets that need to be sliced. Each baking paper is 9\" x 13\", perfectly fits the standard 9x13 inch baking sheet and the sheets are neatly placed in a handy box. Just pull one of the pre-cut parchment paper for baking out and it's ready to use. No more curled edges. 【NON-STICK & EASY TO CLEAN】Still struggling with the clean-up after baking? Our non-stick parchment sheets are waterproof, oil-proof, non-smoke, non-waxed, heat-resistant, and will reduce the time of daily cleaning the baking tray after cooking. Just putting our baking parchment paper on your baking sheets means you don’t have to grease, and cookies will slide right off. Let's enjoy baking time with parchment baking paper! 【MULTIPLE USES】 Our pre-cut parchment paper for baking is perfect for baking, cooking, steaming, and storing food. You can use the cooking paper with oven, microwave even freezer, and during the use of the product (within the tolerable temperature range), there will be no scorching and liquid penetration of the baking paper for oven. 【NATURAL& HEALTHY MATERIAL】 Our food-grade silicone coating of unbleached parchment paper makes your baking safe. Baking paper sheets can be used on both sides and passed the SGS test. Parchment paper has high density and strong toughness and has good bearing capacity. 【HELPFUL TIPS】1. Store the parchment paper sheets for baking in cool and dry place. 2. Do not directly touch open flames or fire sources, and use parchment paper sheets 9\"x13\" isolation with other appliances. 3. Do not leak the parchment paper for air fryer on the outside of the baking tray, and do not dry roast without food. 4. When used in a frying pan, the temperature of the frying pan shouldn’t be too high (tolerable temperature is 41°F/5°C up to 446°F/230°C)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c9hA8O88L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YRYM HT","source_asin":"B093KZ92RR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093KZ92RR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093KZ92RR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
