window.products.push({"id":241158,"name":"Large Ceramic Butter Dish with Airtight Lid and Knife for Countertop- Holds Up to 2 Sticks Butter Container with Bamboo Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SmVQ2TuYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SEALS TIGHT: The butter dish comes with an attractive bamboo lid that has a tight silicone seal. The butter dish’s silicone seal is air tight and will help keep the butter fresh and safe from outside contaminants. Butter kept in this container will keep at room temperature for several days, and provide any chef easy access to the butter to cook with. EASY TO SPREAD: Are you looking for a way to keep butter soft and spreadable? Look no further, this butter dish allows you keep butter right on the counter, ready to be enjoyed at any time. Butter dish will keep butter room temperature, soft, and provide easy access when cooking. GREAT SIZE: This butter container is large enough to accommodate any brand of butter, no matter the shape or sizes of the butter. The container is large and deep enough to hold two standard sized sticks of butter or even a large square of butter. This dish is great for storing large amounts of butter, so you won’t have to refill the dish as often. WELL-DESIGNED: The butter dish’s bamboo top is modern, classy, and attractive, making it a wonderful addition to any kitchen. The container is durable and easy to clean. The butter dish with lid and knife can be washed in the dishwasher, and the bamboo cover can be rinsed with water and then wiped dry. It even comes with a knife to cut the butter with, so you will never need to dig through the silverware drawer again in search of a clean butter knife. WONDERFULLY MADE: The bamboo cover is crack resistant, made of top quality material, and is durable. The container will not only look great on the counter but also last a long time. The butter dish with knife is nicely packaged and shipped with care, making it a lovely addition to your home or it can be given as a gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SmVQ2TuYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIPMEN","source_asin":"B09722H2J4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09722H2J4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09722H2J4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
