window.products.push({"id":241191,"name":"Bed Maker’s Never Lift Your Mattress Microfiber Wrap-Around Bed Skirt, Gathered Ruffled Style, Classic 14 Inch Drop Length, King, Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NNFWDCOsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Everyone loves the finished look a bed skirt gives to your room, but no one loves the hassle of putting one on. The patented* Bed Maker's Never Lift Your Mattress Bed Skirt makes it a breeze to give your bedroom a hotel-quality look without lifting your heavy mattress. The hidden elastic band at the head of your bed slips around your mattress, and the mitered corners at the foot of the bed lock the skirt in place. We’ve also included spiral bed skirt pins for added security and to ensure the best fit with your bed. Our exclusive design is ideal for older adults and single people or those with back problems to use in furnished rental homes, or anyone who wants to take the stress out of housework. The ruffled design works with just about all bed linens from modern comforter sets to traditional quilts and solid or patterned sheets. The classic 14” drop conceals unsightly box springs, platforms, or generic metal bed frames to give your space a pulled together look. Adding a bed skirt also allows you to use the area under your bed as additional storage, which is particularly helpful in smaller homes, dorm rooms, apartments, and vacation homes. Bed Maker’s reduced the size of our packaging to leave less of a carbon footprint. Make your life easier and your room neater with the help of Bed Maker’s. Quick Tip: To remove any wrinkles, place the bed skirt in the dryer for five minutes with a damp washcloth on high heat. *United States Patent 9167920, October 27, 2015","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NNFWDCOsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bed Maker's","source_asin":"B08HW6DSJC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241191","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HW6DSJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HW6DSJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
