window.products.push({"id":241344,"name":"DEMDACO Regal Beagle Burlap Box Sign","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O1e-IyhrL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Dogs Rock was influenced by Stephen's Wrigley Field neighborhood, where man's best friend seemed to be part of everyone's family. He hopes his work reminds you of a favorite pet or adds a funky lightheartedness to your life. Stephen likes rustic and vintage styles and is continuously refining and adding complexity to his approach. He characterizes his work as simple yet eclectic, bold and graphic. Because of the support of Chicagoans, he was able to turn selling works at the farmer's market into a full time gig. Stephen left Chicago three years ago, returning to his hometown of Perrysburg, Ohio where he enjoys golfing and kicking back with his high school sweetheart bride and their dog Lola, the Golden-Doodle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O1e-IyhrL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEMDACO","source_asin":"B009KAXREC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009KAXREC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009KAXREC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":241345,"name":"NANITHG Large Area Rugs,Middle Earth maps,Bedroom Rugs Home Decor Floor Carpet Inside Floor Mat Door Rugs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oWbn9TBFS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This eye-catching floor rug makes an attractive focal point in a room while flattering a wide range of décor schemes. A versatile choice for your living room, dining room or bedroom, it’s as much a piece of art as it is a functional floor covering. The Second Sofa Rather than gathering around the TV, more and more families are doing several activities at once in the living room – which often sees the rug functioning as an alternative to the sofa. As with a sofa, choose a style that complements your other furnishings. For instance, if your walls are a neutral shade, a bright rug can add an accent of colour and individuality. A Rug for Every Room Your rug should be the first thing you sink your toes into after stepping out of bed. So, when choosing a new rug for your bedroom, you want it to feel soft and comfortable underfoot.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oWbn9TBFS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NANITHG","source_asin":"B097P2RD8V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097P2RD8V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097P2RD8V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
