window.products.push({"id":241514,"name":"Accumulair Platinum 20x21.5x1 (Actual Size) MERV 11 Air Filter/Furnace Filters (4 pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cOc+bTbwL._AC_SL1296_.jpg","description":"The Accumulair Platinum 20x21.5x1 air filter contains a unique synthetic media that provides high-efficiency filtration without comprising your airflow. The Tribo-Electric media is made up of co-polymer micro-fibers that are hydrophobic, which means the filter does not absorb moisture and will not support the growth and spread of harmful contaminants. To increase durability, the pleated media is laminated to a metal backing that is recyclable, galvanized, and corrosion-resistant. This filter is equipped with media tested to perform at the Minimum Efficiency Reporting Value of 11 (MERV 11) by an independent lab according to ASHRAE Standard 52.2. The high-performance filter captures up to 94% or more of airborne contaminants such as dust, lint, dust mite debris, cement dust, lead dust, standing dust, small fibers, pet dander, and other airborne contaminants. All MERV data and statements are indicative of typical properties and characteristics obtainable. MERV claims are to be used as a guide for general comparison and not as a specification.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cOc+bTbwL._AC_SL1296_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Accumulair","source_asin":"B003ZHM0C6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003ZHM0C6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003ZHM0C6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":241515,"name":"Ergonomic Office Chair,Desk Chairs with Wheels,Adjustable Arms, Wide Headrest, Lumbar Support and Mesh High Back Comfortable for Heavy People Work at ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Aw4UQV4bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Breathable & Comfortable Ergonomic Office Chair】The ergonomic chair back and lumbar support is made of high quality breathable polyester mesh material which eliminates sweating and moisture to keep you cool and comfortable. High density memory foam filled big office chair seat cushion resists deformation to provide support that lasts all day long. 【Ergonomic Design Home Office Chair】:This S-shaped high back office chair lumbar support fits the curve of the human body and provides spine protection for long time sitting.Wide headrest with cushion offers more comfortable experience to relax your neck and head.In addition,With a built-in lumbar support can be adjusted up and down to the most suitable support position.Byroras black desk chair will allows you to fully enjoy sitting while working or resting. 【Flexible Adjustment Mesh Office Chair】:Byroras adjustable office chair armrest can be adjusted by 6 levels which will provide comfortable support for the arms with different sitting postures.The enjoyable tilt and rocking function,you can tilt and lock the backrest between 90°-120°,8cm up and down for seat height adjustment, 360°freedom to swivel freely. 【Strong & Durable Ergonomic Back Office Chair】:Heavy duty seat plate and strong steel gas lift,lift up and down test 120,000 times, The maximum load-bearing capacity of the swivel office chair is 150KG.Smooth, quiet, and scratch-free nylon wheels suitable for different floors.It is suitable for work or rest in living rooms, meeting rooms and offices.Best rolling desk chair for home office and bedroom. 【Reliable Warranty】:Byroras tall office chair with lumbar support have 2-year warranty. If you have any quality problem, please feel free to contact us immediately, we will provide you with a 100% satisfactory solution fast. Besides, this boss office chair comes with clear instructions and a full set of assembly tools.It can be easily installed by one person,so don't worry completely.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Aw4UQV4bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BYRORAS","source_asin":"B0922K9NSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241515","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0922K9NSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0922K9NSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
