window.products.push({"id":241574,"name":"Cooler Kitchen 3 Liter White Countertop Compost Bin - Kitchen compost bin with EZ-No Lock Lid, Plastic Liner & Charcoal Filters - Sturdy Construction ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614AiWx52YL._AC_SL1450_.jpg","description":"ODOR BLOCKING AND FRUIT FLY FREE – Our counter top kitchen compost bin comes with one thick activated-charcoal filters to trap and absorb odors, leaving your kitchen smelling fresh and clean. The lid effectively blocks smells from escaping and keeps fruit flies away. Our compost container is great for apartments, offices, homes, and more! EASY TO OPEN - The light-lift lid seals out odors and keeps out pests, without the hassle of a lock or clasp that would create an obstacle to opening the compost bin. Very convenient for using multiple times while preparing a meal! HIGH QUALITY & NO ASSEMBLY – We love our compost bin’s classic modern look and sturdy construction. Our bin is made of high quality metal- carbon steel that will not rust, stain, or retain odors like other plastic or stainless steel bins. The only assembly requited is to simply insert the filter into the lid! Our compost bin will last you forever and won’t break even with frequent wear- it’s so easy, you’ll want to use it all the time! REMOVABLE PLASTIC LINER WITH HANDLE MAKES CLEANING A BREEZE - The removable plastic liner makes both emptying your compost bin and cleaning easy and efficient. It's even dishwasher safe! Other compost bins may leak - but with an interior bucket it's leakproof! ENVIRONMENTAL BENEFITS - This composting bin will not only help you in your kitchen but it will also help the planet. With the indoor compost bin/ compost accelerator you will take your first steps towards building a better future for your kids.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614AiWx52YL._AC_SL1450_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cooler Kitchen","source_asin":"B087ZL8T7Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087ZL8T7Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087ZL8T7Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
