window.products.push({"id":241669,"name":"M-Pieces Marble Coasters for Drinks | Featuring 6 of the World’s Wonders on Stone | Best Travel Gift Ideas for Men & Women | No Slip & Water Absorbent","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ofzmAwiiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tired of seeing plain and dull coasters on your tables? Since you always see your coasters, we’re pretty sure that you’ve wished they looked better. When your guests start to ask about your coaster’s design, don’t you want a better answer than just saying you chose them because they looked good? Marvel on the World’s Wonders while keeping your tables dry! Our marble coasters will let you enjoy your beverage without the worry of cleaning up water rings and wet stains. Each boasts superior water absorption and the ideal diameter for all kinds of glasses. They’re extremely durable and the coaster’s paint won’t fade away despite frequent use. Our coasters are perfect for travel enthusiasts who have seen the Wonders in person, or for passionate wanderlusts planning to visit them in the future. See the World’s Wonders in full glory. Each coaster features a picturesque view of the world’s cultural heritage: 🇨🇳 Great Wall of China – Built between the 5th and 16th century B.C. to protect the Chinese empire from the invading Mongols. It’s also the longest cemetery on Earth.🇧🇷 Christ the Redeemer of Brazil – A 130-foot soapstone statue that sits atopthe Corcovado Mountain.🇵🇪 Machu Picchu of Peru – Incan Citadel atop the Andes Mountains, sitting 7,000 meters above sea level. This sanctuary can only be reached by foot, train, or helicopter.🇮🇹 Roman Colosseum of Italy – The largest amphitheatre that exhibited the finest spectacles and gruelling fights during the rule of Emperor Titus.🇮🇳 Taj Mahal of India – A pristine mausoleum built during Emperor Shah Jahan’s reign to honor his favorite wife, Mumtaz Mahal.🇪🇬 Great Pyramids of Giza – Estimated to have around 2.3 million stone blocks, these pyramids were the tallest structures on Earth for 3,800 years. Let your new marble coasters take you all over the world while you enjoy your drink. Click “Add to Cart” NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ofzmAwiiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"M-Pieces","source_asin":"B07L6CWVYW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L6CWVYW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L6CWVYW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":241670,"name":"Cork Stopper Size 18: Pack of 10 (1.5 Inches Each)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.35,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51poUiJaANL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Corks are an unsurpassed sealant for kitchenware, laboratory glassware, masking, and various industrial applications. Impermeable and impervious to chemical interactions with liquid contents, the reusable cork is the perfect sealant. All of our corks are pressed, not amalgamated. Pressed is a more natural state and does not have the glue additives that agglomerated corks have. Unlike petroleum, gas, coal and other diminishing natural resources, cork is the outer bark that grows on replenish-able, renewable, inexhaustible evergreen oaks known by the Latin name Quercus (oak) Suber (cork). Almost 80% of the world's cork comes from the Iberian Peninsula - Portugal (51%) and Spain (28%) where soil, temperature, rainfall, and wind conditions are ideal. Like cows that continually renew their supply of milk or moose that regrow their antlers - the cork tree regenerates its precious outer layer 12 or 13 times during its 150 year lifetime. The outer bark is harvested every 8 to 10 years after the initial first stripping at 15 to 20 years","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51poUiJaANL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sommer Cork","source_asin":"B0067NZKFE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0067NZKFE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0067NZKFE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
