window.products.push({"id":241718,"name":"Evaporative Air Cooler, MEPTY Swamp Cooler with 4.2 Gallons Water Tank, Remote Control, 3 Modes & Speeds, 90°Oscillation, 12H Timer, Portable Air Cool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GTn20HasL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【FAN & HUMIDIFIER & COOLING】The MEPTY portable evaporative air cooler combines three energy-saving functions: cool, fan, and humidify modes, to meet all of your refrigeration and ventilation needs. If you live in a dry climate and want a cost-effective cooling solution, our standing-up evaporative cooler is definitely worth considering. 【3 SPEEDS & MODES】 The portable air cooler features three adjustable wind-speed air supply modes (Normal, Natural, and Sleep) to better control the room temperature. The wind speed can be customized to high, medium, or low to meet your different demands. 【REMOTE & PANEL CONTROL】 The MEPTY swamp cooler adopts dual control modes. The simple touch panel is intuitive and easy to operate, and you can control it with the included remote. You can easily enjoy a gentle outdoor breeze in your room while reading your favorite book or watching a recent series without getting up from the couch or bed. 【DUAL WATER TANK DESIGN】The MEPTY evaporative cooler has a Dual Water Tank system, with a top and a bottom water tank (4.23 Gal), you can add water to either the top or bottom of the tank, don't have to bend over to fill it. That can run for up to 12 hours when fully refilled. For even more cooling, you can add the 4 included frozen ice packs to the tank. The cooling time will vary depending on the humidity of the room. 【CARRY AROUND COOLING ANYWHERE】Cool air wherever you need it, from bedrooms to dorm rooms to recreational trailers. Its compact size fits easily into any small area or corner, such as under tables and dining tables. With 4 universal castors and a hidden handle at the backside you can move the air cooler easily to other places when needed. Package includes: 1 x air cooler, 2 x ice box, 1 x remote control, 1 x manual, 4 x castors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GTn20HasL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEPTY","source_asin":"B091699YK5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241718","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091699YK5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091699YK5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
