window.products.push({"id":241798,"name":"Shower Caddy Bathroom Shelf, Stainless Steel Shower Organizer with Traceless Adhesive Hooks for Conditioner Storage, No Drilling Wall Mounted Shower R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f3P4doV7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If your space doesn't allow much room for shower supplies out of sight, use this basket for a cute storage solution that'll add some flair to the room. This piece adds a fun pop that will be as much a part of the decor as a functional storage item. Features: ▷Durable Stainless Steel Construction ▷Large Capacity Storage & Organizing ▷Wire Construction Lets You View Stored Items from Any Angle ▷Modern Bathroom Decoration ▷Strong Adhesive Hooks ▷Perfect to Store Any Shower Accessories Material: Stainless Steel Packing List: 2 * Stainless Steel Shower Caddy 4 * Adhesive Hook 2 * Traceless Adhesive How to Use: 1. Clean up the Wall and Dry before Using. 2. Tear Off the Protective Film of Adhesive. 3. Paste on the Wall and Squeeze Out Air. 4. Hang the Wire Storage Basket, Plate and Wait for 12-24 hours to use. Notes: 1. Please be sure to mount it on smooth, flat and dry surface. 2. Don’t stick the hook on painted wall or wallpaper.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f3P4doV7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bawuie","source_asin":"B096MZ4TL7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096MZ4TL7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096MZ4TL7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
