window.products.push({"id":241831,"name":"Essy serum for skin care pink 1 pack 60ML","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51e1X+OAdTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"BASIC INFO: Name: Wine Decanter Model: JPS-01 Material: Acrylic + silicone Products include: a decanter + color box packing Applicable: 1.7-2CM regular wine bottleneck. PRODUCT FEATURES: * Can also used as wine pourer. * The product is small, exquisite & portable, which is a must-have wine tool & accessory. * Wines benefit from being aerated before being served to enhance the flavor and bouquet. The aerating pouer allows instant by-the-glass decanting. * No mess! Features a removable splash-guard to allow air in but does not let wine out. * Easy to clean. Just run it under hot water. * Features an air intake system to aerate as your pour. * Fits onto your bottle for a one-hand operation. * Improves the bouquet and flavor of the wine as you pour by injecting air directly into the wine. * Dripless pour spout. How To USE: Insert it into bottleneck directly and then the decanting process is completed, which may take 30 mins in the traditional way. BUT WHAT REALLY MATTERS IS EFFECT ON WINE 1. Better bouquet Sample the nose. You'll appreciate the subtle aromatic differences and the full aroma of the wine. Decanter allows wine to display its intended aromas. 2.Enhanced flavors  Go ahead, take a sip. Decanter's wine tastes better. It is more flavorful and has better mouth-feel. It tastes like a richer, more expensive wine. It tastes like it was intended to and is more enjoyable. 3. Smoother finish Ahhh. Decanter's aeration is very effective at softening tannins which results in a much more pleasure finish. Any bitterness or bad aftertaste is reduced or eliminated.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51e1X+OAdTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Essy","source_asin":"B01DTPGP9M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241831","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DTPGP9M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DTPGP9M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
