window.products.push({"id":241869,"name":"Newbridge Navy Blue and Gold Fancy Metallic Christmas Trees Fabric Holiday Tablecloth, Xmas Tree Contemporary Soil Resistant Easy Care Tablecloth, 60”","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EBleKemjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the Newbridge Holiday Table Linen Collection. This contemporary woven fabric tablecloth was designed to be a favorite for your busy home or restaurant. The Navy and Gold Fancy Metallic Christmas Trees No-Iron Soil Resistant Fabric Holiday Tablecloths feature an allover woven Xmas tree design with a subtle visual texture in gold metallic on an navy blue background. Great for use with adults and children at home or in commercial settings. Perfect for decorating for Christmas, Chanukah, Winter and New Year’s dinner parties, weddings, banquets, holiday entertaining and everyday use. 100% polyester construction is easy care and soil resistant. Machine washable and tumble dry and requires little or no ironing. Finished with merrowed edges. Easy to fold and store when not in use. The Newbridge Navy Blue and Gold Fancy Metallic Trees Christmas No-Iron Soil Resistant Fabric Holiday are available in selection of 7 sizes and matching napkins. Other Colors: Navy/Gold and Grey/Silver combinations. Sizes available are: 52” Square, 52 x 70 Oblong, 60 x 84 Oblong, 60 x 84 Oval, 60 x 102 Oblong, 60 x 120 Oblong and 70 Round. Matching Napkins are sold separately in sets of 8.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EBleKemjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Newbridge","source_asin":"B09JHTZYRJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241869","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JHTZYRJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JHTZYRJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":241870,"name":"Selanto 36'' Tower Fan with Remote, Portable 80° Oscillating Fan Tower, Large LED Display, Touch Control, 12H Timer, 3 Speeds, 3 Modes, Quiet Bladeles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.93,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VwOM1-OsS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPACE SAVING WIDE OSCILLATING TOWER FAN: 80° wide angle oscillation offers a broad distribution of airflow to the space, making every corner of the room covered in breeze. The slim and sleek bladeless tower design requires no extra space under oscillating, making the fan possible to sit right against the corner without interfering the surroundings, is perfect for any bedroom, living room, home office, loft, basement, garage, RV camper. AIRFLOW CUSTOMIZATION: Tower fan is equipped with 3 speeds and 3 modes (Normal, Natural, Sleep), offering 9 air circulation combinations to meet all your needs. The powerful and efficient pure copper motor pairing with airflow focused wind channel ensures max wind velocity of 22ft/s. While the sleep mode offers ultra quiet breeze under 35dB, even the most sensitive ears can enjoy a sound sleep without disturbance. CONVENIENT TO USE: The large LED display clearly shows current room temperature and which speeds/modes the fan is operating. The top control panel is touch enabled, the remote control is effective up to 20 feet distance. You can adjust all settings by gentle finger taps, or using the remote control from the distance without moving an inch. The 12-hour programmable timer lets you set certain hours of running time before the fan shuts off automatically. SIMPLE AND COMPACT DESIGN: The tower fan is super easy to assemble. It only takes several screws to attach the base to the body and you are all set. The built-in handle at the rear not only makes the fan portable, but also can be used as a storage for the remote control. SAFETY FOR KIDS AND PETS: The 12-inch diameter base makes sure the tower fan stand steady and resist to side forces. The narrow fences at front and back is specially designed for use with children and pets. No need to worry about your kids or pets accidentally tripping over the tower fan, or sticking fingers or paws into the tower fan and get hurt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VwOM1-OsS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Selanto","source_asin":"B09ZPS4GRG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241870","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZPS4GRG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZPS4GRG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
