window.products.push({"id":241952,"name":"Topcee Cooling Blanket for Night Sweats Decorative Tie Dye, Absorbs Heat to Keep Cool on Warm Nights, Q-Max 0.5 Cooling Blankets for Hot Sleepers, Ult","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UzdbMlnOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄【LONG-LASTING COOLING FEEL】With a Cool-sense Value(Q-max) of More Than 0.5,this revolutionary Arc-chill cooling fiber has a incredible long- lasting cooling feel. The Arc-chill cooling fiber fabric can not only quickly absorb the body heat but keeping the long-last cooling feel.A cool bed blanket can be a great help for night sweats and hot sleepers -- it'll keep you cool and dry all night. ❄【LUXURIOUS LOOKING AND SPECIAL WEAVING METHOD】Cool blankets with decorative tie-dye craftsmanship are perfect for decorating our room, Due to Topcee factory adopted a high-strength special weaving method,our cooling fiber can reach to 400TC (other cooling fabrics can only meet 300TC),which makes it have higher specific heat capacity,so Topcee's cooling blanket can keep cool for a longer time,rather then for an instant of coolness. ❄【2 IN 1 DESIGN FOR A YEAR USE】Cooling touch for spring/summer, Revolutionary 100% Mica Nylon.Warm touch for winter/fall, Special 100% Protein Microfiber.which is soft, skin-friendly,comfortable and breathable. ❄【TRAVEL, OFFICE, HOME】The Topcee Cooling Blanket measures 2 sizes: 50x70 inches&60x80 inches.For the blanket of 50x70inches,it's so light and easy-to-carry.You can take it to anywhere even if you need take different vehicles such as the car,plane,ship,train or any others.The 60x80 inches one is good for double and full beds.You can always trust Topcee these cooling blankets are definitely your good choice,hether in your kids'room,your cars or on your camping & business trip. ❄【EASY CARE】Thanks for the high-strength weave,the cooling blankets are totally machine washable.However,better to put the blanket in a laundry mesh bag to prevent tangling and damage.Hang dry is recommended.Besides, it's also a great birthday, holiday or anniversary gift for your important people.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UzdbMlnOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Topcee","source_asin":"B0BGNXBKDZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-241952","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGNXBKDZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGNXBKDZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
